{"unit_id":"Mongfayi__dsh-recall#feature-1","repo":"Mongfayi/dsh-recall","commit":"53ba9479f3f9a53a36a89f48d41f5c0170b322fb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-recall 的功能「整段撤回」：从选中的消息起隐藏后续会话内容，并把撤回范围写入持久会话日志。用户在消息旁触发操作，宿主校验边界后追加墓碑并 flush。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:229-260","lib/index.js:263-310"]}
